    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_001"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? How deep are we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weary-eyed Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_006",
        "name2": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Reckon we should dig a little more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pasty-faced Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll all be a wasteland here sooner or later. It's not like you could stick wheels under the graves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pasty-faced Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Folks want to leave behind some trace of their lives after they die... but it's all a pointless dream, sadly. Might as well ask for a cremation and have your ashes scattered in the wilderness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pasty-faced Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_006",
        "name2": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That would put us out of a job, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weary-eyed Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_006",
        "name2": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "True enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pasty-faced Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_006",
        "name2": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ask me, graves aren't for the dead. It's the living who need these things... The ceremonies and the big chunk of rock that goes on top of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weary-eyed Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those are the things that folks say their goodbyes to before starting anew\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weary-eyed Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_006",
        "name2": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, until it's their turn to bite the dust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pasty-faced Gravedigger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "26_g5_laterano_chapelout",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The preparations for the ritual are almost complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm not sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't feel so good today...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Friar, I was really happy yesterday...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosella told me about lots of fun stuff... We prepared for the funeral together, and it felt like... I was doing something for Mamma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... we're done with everything now... What comes next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think... I worked really hard... for Mamma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... can Mamma see all that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does all of this... really mean something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Friar, have you gone through this a lot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "When it happens... during... the funeral... what... what should I do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And what do I do... once it's over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm. Right, the funeral...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still young, but I don't want to hide anything from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We do a lot of things for others, but, in the end, we do it for ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia, this isn't selfishness. Rather, it just means that, ultimately, everything that the living do is to mold and shape themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "We hold funerals and say our goodbyes when our loved ones leave us, but it's also a respite for ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a way to mark the road that we've trodden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many grown-ups... use this as a way to find peace, but whether they truly find it, or indeed anything, isn't the fault of the funeral itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's really up to us, after we go through the thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once we are done looking back and resting, we must keep going forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But where do we go after that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That is something you need to ask yourself, Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a question that only you can answer yourself, and it's a question that both you, I, and everyone must answer in our lifetimes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ask myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Only you can find the right way forward for yourself, and it is only with your own two legs that you can walk that path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you, Mister Friar? You know so much... What is your road like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't answer you that. I'm afraid I can't even say I've found it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a tough search, and a sad journey. It makes you wonder if the way forward ever truly exists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I haven't given up, and that is why I, and my brothers and sisters, call ourselves...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...'the Pathfinders.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
