    {
        "text": "Candelabra, candelabra. Where does one find...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Somebody's there... That Liberi from the hospital? Patia, was it? And the Legatus called Oren, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I really don't get it. What is that guy even doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your words, Oren.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the perfect time to act. There are lots of other things we could be doing besides wasting time on a funeral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I thought you were close to the girl's mother. How cold-blooded of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd already made my decision when I told Andoain about Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's capable of knocking this city off its godly throne.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That also means she can shake that saint who's always hiding behind the red and gold curtain... and plenty of others besides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What is he talking about?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A Sankta wants to bring down his holy city with the help of a mixed-blood girl? Scandalous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You make it sound like I just want to burn it all down for no good reason. I said 'capable.' That doesn't mean we have to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "In fact, if we don't do it, then her worth as a bargaining chip is that much more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just have to make sure Cecelia doesn't end up in the Pope's hands... On that point at least, Andoain and I are aligned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A word of advice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what kind of tricks you're trying to play with Cecelia, but do not forget the promise you made to the Guide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks for the tip... I don't mind walking this path with you folks for a little longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, you'll have to excuse me. I have better places to be than a funeral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Looks like they aren't all on the same wavelength.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But what worries me more... is that there's a Legatus involved.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'll take Cecelia and leave once the funeral is over.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
