    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia. Cecelia!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Senior Ezell, the funeral will be starting soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Andoain, I don't care about your grand ideals, and I'm not interested in discussing faith with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So once the funeral is over... I'm leaving with Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where will you go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "None of your concern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time to light the candles, Senior Ezell. Go, be with Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
