    },
    {
        "text": "The early spring mornings are still frigid here in Laterano."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sankta funerals are often accompanied by laughter, music, sweets, and the occasional, inconsequential explosion."
    },
    {
        "text": "The departed become one with the Holy Spirit and return to Heaven. This is worthy of celebration."
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is another kind of Sankta 'funeral' unknown to other races:"
    },
    {
        "text": "On a certain hour of a certain day, a great sorrow will seize all Sankta by the throat. They will not be able to move, breathe, or avert their eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Each and every fragile soul will be swept away as if by the floodwaters of a broken dam."
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet neither the joy of the former nor the awesome power of the latter can be found today in the Ecclesia Requietum of Pagus Stevonus."
    },
    {
        "text": "We find only a frail girl, trying her hardest to swing the absurdly unwieldy shovel in her hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "A girl trying to shovel the last bit of dirt onto her mother's resting place."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, Cecelia. It's time to see goodbye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma... What should I do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I think to myself that... I'm doing this for Mamma, I don't feel scared of anything... I feel like I can do anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "It feels like I've gotten a little stronger since you've been gone... Is it because I got a little older?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Mister Ezell says... I won't get to see you anymore. Even if I grow up and grow even stronger, I won't see you again... right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I do a good job, you won't be there to reward me... When I do something bad, you won't be there to get angry at me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, why should I grow up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Friar says... I'm doing your funeral and saying goodbye to you... for myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What does it mean to do something for myself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm scared... Mamma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "A few days ago, a prioress lady that I don't know told me that, whether we do it with tears or smiles, the ones who are leaving us will accept our goodbyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't get it... Mamma, should I cry, or should I smile?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Friar said it's a question for myself... but I... I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no rush, Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still have lots of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad, then, that yours just ran out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
