    {
        "text": "Hey, been a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've finally got you, Andoain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mostima, Fiammetta... my dear old friends, long time no see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're here to mourn the dead, I'm afraid you came a little too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can always make some more.",
        "tag": "name",
